stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Initiated

    Initiated --> FundsHeld : fraud checks pass AND wallet has enough funds / hold funds
    Initiated --> Rejected : fraud check fails OR insufficient funds

    FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent to biller

    SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms
    SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
    SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer within 10-second timeout

    Unknown --> Completed : biller later confirms (callback, retry or settlement file)
    Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses OR reconciliation finds no payment

    Failed --> Refunded : hold released to wallet / release hold

    Completed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]

    note right of FundsHeld
        Amount moved from available balance to held balance.
    end note

    note right of Unknown
        Re-queried 3 times (after 1, 5 and 15 minutes),
        then waits for reconciliation.
        Never refunded automatically.
    end note